WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.790
A role title is not a grant of authority Role

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:09.880
titles vary and can overlap An EA PA office manager

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.890
chief of staff and specialist adviser may work closely but

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:18.965
proximity to an executive does not transfer another role’s mandate

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:25.740
Production judgement and coordination are connected contributions not ranks Compare

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.610
what each role has actually been appointed to do before

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:34.085
deciding where a request belongs Compare responsibilities and identify the

00:00:34.085 --> 00:00:38.410
appointed owner for a task that goes beyond Daniel’s role
